views and job search preparation, career fairs and employer connections, our Handshake job search database, student employment coordination and training, volunteer and service-learning programs, career treks, professional mentorship programs, living-learning and theme communities, and the Monarch Pantry. Students Students Employers Employers Faculty & Staff Faculty & Staff Alumni Alumni Center for Career & Leadership Development Home About Us Students Leadership & Professional Development Career Coaching & Job Search Service Learning Experiential Learning Student Employment Living-Learning & Theme Communities Quinncia Employers Career Fairs ODU Career Summit Employer Advisory Board Employer Partners Eligibility Guidelines Faculty & Staff Career Champions Classroom Presentations On-Campus Student Employment Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Quinncia for Faculty Alumni Events Contact Center for Career & Leadership Development 2202 Webb University Center Norfolk, VA 23529 757-683-4388 office ccld@odu.edu Directory Instagram linkedin youtube Upcoming Events Sep 8 Explore Your Career Universe Open House 11 am Sep 9 Monarchs LEAD - Information Session 12 pm Sep 10 Monarchs LEAD Information Session 12 pm Sep 11 Workforce Recruitment Program (WRP) Information Session 12 pm Sep 15 2026 Fall Business Fair 11 am Sep 16 Graduate Student & Alumni Career Coaching Corners 12 pm Sep 22 Crown-Your-Career Series: Explore Your Options 12:30 pm Sep 30 Leadership Lecture Series (LLS) - Model the Way 12 pm Oct 1 2026 Fall Health and Human Services Fair 11 am Oct 7 Graduate & Alumni Career Coaching Corners AI-Powered Resume using Quinncia 12 pm Oct 13 Crown-Your-Career Series: Career Fair Bootcamp 12:30 pm Oct 14 Graduate & Alumni Career Coaching Corners - The Ultimate Guide to Tech Jobs 12 pm Oct 20 Fall 2026 Resume Refresh: Get Ready for the Career Fair! 9 am Oct 21 Leadership Lecture Series (LLS) - Inspire a Shared Vision 12 pm Oct 22 2026 Fall Career & Internship Fair 11 am Nov 