oyer info sessions and networking events We will send you tailored e-newsletters based on your major and career interests With Handshake we are connecting ODU employers, students, and alumni through part-time, internship, entry-level, and professional opportunities. Handshake Login & Account Creation Students Only Login - MIDAS (SSO) Alumni New Account Creation Employer New Account Creation Existing Employer Login Center for Career & Leadership Development Home About Us Students Leadership & Professional Development Career Coaching & Job Search Service Learning Experiential Learning Student Employment Living-Learning & Theme Communities Quinncia Employers Career Fairs ODU Career Summit Employer Advisory Board Employer Partners Eligibility Guidelines Faculty & Staff Career Champions Classroom Presentations On-Campus Student Employment Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Quinncia for Faculty Alumni Events Contact Center for Career & Leadership Development 2202 Webb University Center Norfolk, VA 23529 757-683-4388 office ccld@odu.edu Directory Instagram linkedin youtube 5115 Hampton Blvd, Norfolk,          VA 23529 Contact Facebook Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Resources Employment Directories University Libraries Alumni Legal Legal & Compliance Privacy Accessibility Health & Safety Emergency Management Campus Hazing Transparency Visit Visit ODU Transportation & Parking Campus Map Copyright © Old Dominion University • Updated 2025"
