ntact Us Center for Career & Leadership Development Home About Us Students Leadership & Professional Development Career Coaching & Job Search Service Learning Experiential Learning Student Employment Living-Learning & Theme Communities Quinncia Employers Career Fairs ODU Career Summit Employer Advisory Board Employer Partners Eligibility Guidelines Faculty & Staff Career Champions Classroom Presentations On-Campus Student Employment Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Quinncia for Faculty Alumni Events Contact Center for Career & Leadership Development 2202 Webb University Center Norfolk, VA 23529 757-683-4388 office ccld@odu.edu Directory Instagram linkedin youtube ODU Career Fairs CCLD sponsors various career fairs through the academic year. Your active participation in our career fairs gives you an opportunity to market to and talk to students and alumni about your organization. Check out Handshake for information on upcoming career fairs. Participate in Career Fairs Attend the ODU Career Summit This conference connects recruiters with ODU faculty and staff, featuring sessions on building talent pipelines and supporting students in their career goals. Learn more about the summit Employer Advisory Board A group of industry professionals dedicated to strengthening the connection between employers and University. Learn more about how you can help enhance employer engagement, improve career services, and align student talent with workforce needs. Learn More Virginia Top The Virginia Talent + Opportunity Partnership (Virginia TOP) connects Virginia businesses that have work-based learning opportunities to Virginia students looking for them, with Virginia’s higher ed institutions serving as the main catalyst. Please explore the V-TOP website to find resources including contact information for Virginia’s public and private post-secondary career professionals, our Employer Readiness Toolkit, and more. 5115 Hampton Blvd, Norfolk,          VA 23529 Contact Facebook Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Resources Employment Directories University Libraries Alumni Legal Legal & Compliance Privacy Accessibility Health & Safety Emergency Management Campus Hazing Transparency Visit Visit ODU Transportation & Parking Campus Map Copyright © Old Dominion University • Updated 2025"
