tation Facts & Figures History & Archives Leadership Leadership Office of the President Administration & Organization Strategic Planning & Initiatives Arts & Culture Back Arts & Culture Arts@ODU Gordon Art Galleries Diehn Concert Series Literary Festival Barry Art Museum Military & Veterans Back Military & Veterans Military Connection Center Army ROTC Navy ROTC Student Life Back Student Life Career & Leadership Development Clubs & Organizations Dining Housing & Residence Life Recreation & Wellness Service & Civic Engagement Student Engagement & Traditions You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Athletics Apply Visit Navigation Back Academics Academic Programs Back Academic Programs All Programs Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs ODUGlobal Continued Learning Colleges & Schools Back Colleges & Schools All Colleges & Schools Batten College of Engineering & Technology Brock Virginia Health Sciences Brock Virginia Health Sciences Eastern Virginia Medical School Ellmer College of Health Sciences Ellmer School of Nursing EVMS School of Health Professions Joint School of Public Health Darden College of Education & Professional Studies Perry Honors College Strome College of Business College of Arts and Letters College of Sciences Graduate School School of Cybersecurity School of Data Science School of Supply Chain, Logistics & Maritime Operations Academic Resources Back Academic Resources Academic Calendar Academic Success Educational Accessibility University Catalogs University Libraries You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Admission Future Students Back Future Students Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Medical Students International Admissions ODUGlobal Military & Veterans Admitted Students Back Admitted Students Undergraduate Graduate International Returning Students Cost & Aid Back Cost & Aid Tuition & Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Cost Estimator GI Bill Benefits You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Research Division of Research Back Division of Research Research Centers Research Compliance Grants & Funding ODU Research Foundation Back ODU Research Foundation You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Life at ODU About ODU Back About ODU At a Glance Accreditation Facts & Figures History & Archives Leadership Leadership Office of the President Administration & Organization Strategic Planning & Initiatives Arts & Culture Back Arts & Culture Arts@ODU Gordon Art Galleries Diehn Concert Series Literary Festival Barry Art Museum Military & Veterans Back Military & Veterans Military Connection Center Army ROTC Navy ROTC Student Life Back Student Life Career & Leadership Development Clubs & Organizations Dining Housing & Residence Life Recreation & Wellness Service & Civic Engagement Student Engagement & Traditions You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Athletics Apply Visit Helpful Links Give Alumni myODU Info for Current Students Faculty & Staff Military Students Parents & Families Apply Visit Leadership & Professional Development Breadcrumb Home Leadership & Professional Development Developing the Next Generation of Leaders ODU's Leadership Program develops self-sufficient, civically minded leaders who cultivate behaviors and values that allow them to actively reinvent and develop leadership practices to overcome challenges and exhibit social responsibility. A variety of leadership programs, such as lectures, conferences, and retreats create opportunities for student leaders to explore and implement proven leadership practices. Students engage in learning, reflection, planning, and application of lessons learned to improve their communities. ODU's Leadership Program aims to be accessible to every student, building on the foundation that we all have the capacity to learn and lead. Monarch Leaders embrace a philosophy of leadership that strives to create consistent small changes today and enlist others so that together we can create greater good. Monarchs LEAD ODU's Comprehensive Leadership Program Learn more about how ODU's Monarchs LEAD Program guides and develops students on their leadership journey at Old Dominion University here . Center for Career & Leadership Development Home About Us Students Leadership & Professional Development Career Coaching & Job Search Service Learning Experiential Learning Student Employment Living-Learning & Theme Communities Quinncia Employers Career Fairs ODU Career Summit Employer Advisory Board Employer Partners Eligibility Guidelines Faculty & Staff Career Champions Classroom Presentations On-Campus Student Employment Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Quinncia for Faculty Alumni Events Contact Center for Career & Leadership Development 2202 Webb University Center Norfolk, VA 23529 757-683-4388 office ccld@odu.edu Directory Instagram linkedin youtube First-Year Leadership Programs First-Year Summer Institute First-Year Summer Institute (FSI) is a three-day intensive leadership program for incoming ODU students held over three unique sessions during the summer. Emerging Monarchs Lay the foundation for a successful leadership journey at ODU during this eight-week fall program. Leadership Development Opportunities Leadership Lecture Series Engage in leadership-focused programs throughout each semester and earn a graduation medal. Leadership Assessment & Certification Explore various leadership inventories and certification opportunities. Courses Continue your growth beyond the Leadership Lecture Series by diving deeper into courses offered on campus. Student & Campus Life Leadership Awards At the end of the school year, ODU recognizes outstanding leaders and organizations for their contributions to the community. 5115 Hampton Blvd, Norfolk,          VA 23529 Contact Facebook Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Resources Employment Directories University Libraries Alumni Legal Legal & Compliance Privacy Accessibility Health & Safety Emergency Management Campus Hazing Transparency Visit Visit ODU Transportation & Parking Campus Map Copyright © Old Dominion University • Updated 2025"
