Cost Estimator GI Bill Benefits You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Research Division of Research Back Division of Research Research Centers Research Compliance Grants & Funding ODU Research Foundation Back ODU Research Foundation You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Life at ODU About ODU Back About ODU At a Glance Accreditation Facts & Figures History & Archives Leadership Leadership Office of the President Administration & Organization Strategic Planning & Initiatives Arts & Culture Back Arts & Culture Arts@ODU Gordon Art Galleries Diehn Concert Series Literary Festival Barry Art Museum Military & Veterans Back Military & Veterans Military Connection Center Army ROTC Navy ROTC Student Life Back Student Life Career & Leadership Development Clubs & Organizations Dining Housing & Residence Life Recreation & Wellness Service & Civic Engagement Student Engagement & Traditions You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Athletics Apply Visit Helpful Links Give Alumni myODU Info for Current Students Faculty & Staff Military Students Parents & Families Apply Visit Career Coaching & Job Search Breadcrumb Home Career Coaching & Job Search Your Career Journey Starts Here Whether you're exploring your options, changing direction, or preparing to launch your career, the Center for Career & Leadership Development is here to help. Our expert career coaches offer personalized support to undergraduate students, graduate students, and alumni—guiding you every step of the way as you build confidence, discover your strengths, and develop the tools to succeed in today’s job market. Get Started Today! Take charge of your future with CCLD. Schedule your career coaching session today on Handshake and start your journey toward a successful and fulfilling career. Schedule An Appointment on Handshake Ready to take the next step in your career journey? Whether you're just starting out or looking to advance, we’re here to help you succeed. Schedule Your Career Coaching Appointment on Handshake Click on the “Career Center Tab” Click on Appointments Schedule A new appointment Drop-In: Don’t have a career coaching appointment scheduled? We offer Career Commons Express Drop-In on Tuesdays, Wednesdays, and Thursdays from 10 am – 3 pm.  Visit us at 2202 Webb Center. Explore Explore Find a Job Find a Job Resources Resources Center for Career & Leadership Development Home About Us Students Leadership & Professional Development Career Coaching & Job Search Service Learning Experiential Learning Student Employment Living-Learning & Theme Communities Quinncia Employers Career Fairs ODU Career Summit Employer Advisory Board Employer Partners Eligibility Guidelines Faculty & Staff Career Champions Classroom Presentations On-Campus Student Employment Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Quinncia for Faculty Alumni Events Contact Center for Career & Leadership Development 2202 Webb University Center Norfolk, VA 23529 757-683-4388 office ccld@odu.edu Directory Instagram linkedin youtube Request a Program Career Action Plans Creating a solid career action plan is essential for turning your aspirations into reality. Whether you're just starting to explore your options or ready to take the next step in your journey, a well-crafted plan helps you set clear goals, identify the steps needed to achieve them, and stay on track. The Center for Career and Leadership Development is here to support you in developing a personalized plan that aligns with your interests and strengths, ensuring you're prepared for every stage of your career path. Don't wait—schedule an appointment with us today ► Undergraduate Career Action Plan Graduate Career Action Plan Events Sep 8 Explore Your Career Universe Open House 11 am Sep 9 Monarchs LEAD - Information Session 12 pm Sep 10 Monarchs LEAD Information Session 12 pm Sep 11 Workforce Recruitment Program (WRP) Information Session 12 pm Sep 15 2026 Fall Business Fair 11 am Sep 16 Graduate Student & Alumni Career Coaching Corners 12 pm 5115 Hampton Blvd, Norfolk,          VA 23529 Contact Facebook Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Resources Employment Directories University Libraries Alumni Legal Legal & Compliance Privacy Accessibility Health & Safety Emergency Management Campus Hazing Transparency Visit Visit ODU Transportation & Parking Campus Map Copyright © Old Dominion University • Updated 2025"
