y & Archives Leadership Leadership Office of the President Administration & Organization Strategic Planning & Initiatives Arts & Culture Back Arts & Culture Arts@ODU Gordon Art Galleries Diehn Concert Series Literary Festival Barry Art Museum Military & Veterans Back Military & Veterans Military Connection Center Army ROTC Navy ROTC Student Life Back Student Life Career & Leadership Development Clubs & Organizations Dining Housing & Residence Life Recreation & Wellness Service & Civic Engagement Student Engagement & Traditions You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Athletics Apply Visit Navigation Back Academics Academic Programs Back Academic Programs All Programs Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs ODUGlobal Continued Learning Colleges & Schools Back Colleges & Schools All Colleges & Schools Batten College of Engineering & Technology Brock Virginia Health Sciences Brock Virginia Health Sciences Eastern Virginia Medical School Ellmer College of Health Sciences Ellmer School of Nursing EVMS School of Health Professions Joint School of Public Health Darden College of Education & Professional Studies Perry Honors College Strome College of Business College of Arts and Letters College of Sciences Graduate School School of Cybersecurity School of Data Science School of Supply Chain, Logistics & Maritime Operations Academic Resources Back Academic Resources Academic Calendar Academic Success Educational Accessibility University Catalogs University Libraries You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Admission Future Students Back Future Students Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Medical Students International Admissions ODUGlobal Military & Veterans Admitted Students Back Admitted Students Undergraduate Graduate International Returning Students Cost & Aid Back Cost & Aid Tuition & Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Cost Estimator GI Bill Benefits You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Research Division of Research Back Division of Research Research Centers Research Compliance Grants & Funding ODU Research Foundation Back ODU Research Foundation You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Life at ODU About ODU Back About ODU At a Glance Accreditation Facts & Figures History & Archives Leadership Leadership Office of the President Administration & Organization Strategic Planning & Initiatives Arts & Culture Back Arts & Culture Arts@ODU Gordon Art Galleries Diehn Concert Series Literary Festival Barry Art Museum Military & Veterans Back Military & Veterans Military Connection Center Army ROTC Navy ROTC Student Life Back Student Life Career & Leadership Development Clubs & Organizations Dining Housing & Residence Life Recreation & Wellness Service & Civic Engagement Student Engagement & Traditions You don’t have to have it all figured out. Let’s explore what inspires you - together. EXPLORE PROGRAMS Athletics Apply Visit Helpful Links Give Alumni myODU Info for Current Students Faculty & Staff Military Students Parents & Families Apply Visit Quinncia Breadcrumb Home Quinncia Quinncia is an interactive artificial intelligence-based platform which helps students to build a strong resume and to excel at interviewing. Quinn serves as a virtual assistant who supports students throughout their career journeys by providing custom resume critiques and helping navigate Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) that focus on format and content most relevant to industry roles. For interviewing, Quinn provides tailored virtual practice, simulating the live interview experience. You can upload your resume for review as many times as you would like on Quinncia. Quinn will analyze the content and formatting of your resume and provide detailed feedback. You will learn resume writing best practices that will help you increase your chances of landing your dream job or internship. Our resume analysis will help you draft, finalize, and improve your resume. Access Quinncia Resume Reviews Submit your resume on Quinncia as often as needed for personalized feedback. Quinn will evaluate both the content and format of your resume and offer specific suggestions for improvement. You’ll gain insights into effective resume writing strategies that can strengthen your application and boost your prospects for securing internships or jobs. This analysis is designed to help you refine, finalize, and enhance your resume with confidence. See how Quinncia helps students land their dream job by helping them improve their resumes. Learn More Quinncia Student Intro to ATS Center for Career & Leadership Development Home About Us Students Leadership & Professional Development Career Coaching & Job Search Service Learning Experiential Learning Student Employment Living-Learning & Theme Communities Quinncia Employers Career Fairs ODU Career Summit Employer Advisory Board Employer Partners Eligibility Guidelines Faculty & Staff Career Champions Classroom Presentations On-Campus Student Employment Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Quinncia for Faculty Alumni Events Contact Center for Career & Leadership Development 2202 Webb University Center Norfolk, VA 23529 757-683-4388 office ccld@odu.edu Directory Instagram linkedin youtube Mock Interview With Quinncia, you can schedule an unlimited number of mock AI interviews to help you prepare for the real thing. Quinn will ask you questions tailored to your major, industry of choice, and experiences on your resume. She also analyzes your content, micro-expressions, eye contact, words per minute, level of enthusiasm, and more. Our mock interviews will help you strengthen your interviewing skills. Get an introduction to AI-Interviewing for students with Quinnica. Learn More AI-Interview introduction video by Quinncia 5115 Hampton Blvd, Norfolk,          VA 23529 Contact Facebook Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Resources Employment Directories University Libraries Alumni Legal Legal & Compliance Privacy Accessibility Health & Safety Emergency Management Campus Hazing Transparency Visit Visit ODU Transportation & Parking Campus Map Copyright © Old Dominion University • Updated 2025"
