 Handshake, our online career management tool. In doing so, students and alumni can gain access to company information, job postings, internship and co-op opportunities and more. Tracking By tracking employer, student and alumni data in Handshake, the Center for Career and Leadership Development collects valuable information that allows us to attract new employers to the university and land more ODU students in successful part-time, internships, co-ops and jobs. Center for Career & Leadership Development Home About Us Students Leadership & Professional Development Career Coaching & Job Search Service Learning Experiential Learning Student Employment Living-Learning & Theme Communities Quinncia Employers Career Fairs ODU Career Summit Employer Advisory Board Employer Partners Eligibility Guidelines Faculty & Staff Career Champions Classroom Presentations On-Campus Student Employment Letters of Reference Employer Referrals Quinncia for Faculty Alumni Events 5115 Hampton Blvd, Norfolk,          VA 23529 Contact Facebook Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Resources Employment Directories University Libraries Alumni Legal Legal & Compliance Privacy Accessibility Health & Safety Emergency Management Campus Hazing Transparency Visit Visit ODU Transportation & Parking Campus Map Copyright © Old Dominion University • Updated 2025"
