your bullet points with impact-driven language Align your resume with the employers attending the fair Feel confident walking into conversations Whether this is your first career fair or you’ve attended before, this session is your opportunity to pause, reflect, and fine-tune your story on paper. Employers often decide within seconds whether to continue reviewing a resume — let’s make sure yours stands out for the right reasons. Come prepared with: Your current resume (printed or digital) A job or internship description you’re interested in (if possible) An open mindset ready to grow Our goal is simple: help you walk into the career fair prepared, polished, and confident. Can't make it in-person--Join us on Zoom! 5115 Hampton Blvd, Norfolk,          VA 23529 Contact Facebook Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Resources Employment Directories University Libraries Alumni Legal Legal & Compliance Privacy Accessibility Health & Safety Emergency Management Campus Hazing Transparency Visit Visit ODU Transportation & Parking Campus Map Copyright © Old Dominion University • Updated 2025"
